  <com>option truthycond off</com>
  <com>parse line extern int4 bf(int4 x, int4 *p);</com>
  <com>lo fu bf</com>
  <!-- kuna: branchflip is now default-on (DIV-13); pass 1 explicitly turns it OFF to assert the pre-flip (Ghidra-polarity) rendering -->
